@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #41546B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam classBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF3F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #59708C
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
hide footbox
title 创建分级管理员 · ddd（前置参数合法后的候选层级决策）
autonumber
participant "obj: AccountController" as C
participant "service: DddAuthService" as S
participant "«MetaClass»\n: DddBoundary" as B
participant "accounts: AdminAccountRepositoryPort" as R
participant "roles: AdminRoleRepositoryPort" as Roles
participant "tree: AdminHierarchy" as Tree
participant "crypto: CryptoGateway" as Crypto
participant "rbac: RbacUseCase" as Audit
activate C
C -> S: createAccount(input, actor)
activate S
S -> B: execute(action)
activate B
B -> S: action.get()（应用服务中的 lambda）
activate S
S -> R: lockAllAccounts()
activate R
deactivate R
note over S,Roles: requireRole 校验角色存在；hierarchy() 展开如下
S -> R: nodes = loadHierarchyNodes()
activate R
deactivate R
S -> Roles: functions = functionsByRole()
activate Roles
deactivate Roles
S -> Tree: new AdminHierarchy(nodes, functions)
activate Tree
deactivate Tree
note over S,Tree
requestedParent、node、manages 与范围 ID 解析完成后，
构造 AdminScope 和候选 AdminNode；省略这些成功前置步骤。
end note
alt 候选范围或层级不满足不变量
 S -> Tree: validateCreate(actor.id(), candidate)
 activate Tree
 autonumber stop
 Tree --> B: DomainException (CONFLICT)
 deactivate Tree
 B --> C: ApiException (409 CONFLICT)，事务回滚
else 候选合法
 autonumber resume
 S -> Tree: validateCreate(actor.id(), candidate)
 activate Tree
 deactivate Tree
 note right of S: PasswordPolicy.validateAdminPasswordBytes(input.password())
 autonumber resume
 S -> Crypto: hash = encodeAdminPassword(input.password())
 activate Crypto
 deactivate Crypto
 S -> R: id = createAccount(..., hash, ...)
 activate R
 deactivate R
 S -> R: replaceAccountApplications(id, applications)
 activate R
 deactivate R
 S -> R: replaceAccountDepartments(id, departments)
 activate R
 deactivate R
 S -> Audit: audit(..., ACCOUNT_CREATED, ...)
 activate Audit
 deactivate Audit
 autonumber stop
 S --> B: id
 B --> S: id
 S --> C: id
end
||12||
deactivate S
deactivate B
deactivate S
deactivate C
legend bottom
createAccount 的 @Transactional 覆盖锁、领域决策、写入和审计；DAO 调用由基础设施适配器实现。
DomainException 在 DddBoundary 捕获并转换；Controller 正常返回 200 {id, username}。
endlegend
@enduml
